omething, while Mrs. Kamishiro and Mrs. Arisu sat on the chairs against the wall. [1403] They were wondering where Mr. Oyama and Mr. Nagahara were, when they came from the corridor with \"that thing\" covered in a sheet, which was the dead body of Miss Akagi placed on the robot P1. Edogawa turned his head away, and Mrs. Arisu covered her eyes. [1404] Mr. Yamanaka told Shishir, \"We decided to bring her back to her room.\" [1405] Mr. Oyama and Mr. Nagahara carefully carried the body into the open yellow door, as if placing it in the reception room. They soon came out, and Mr. Yamanaka closed the yellow door. [1406] Yamanaka said, as if speaking to himself, \"Let's just do this until the police come. Then notify all the staff and hold an electronic meeting at 5 o'clock. Please attend. That's about 40 minutes from now. Ise, can you make the call? I want to take a shower first.\" [1407] \"Yoshida, Nagatani, and Mizuguchi, please help me move the Chief's body to the room,\" said Kurauchi. His wife also stood up and walked towards them. \"We can't leave it in the helicopter. The temperature will rise when the sun comes out\u2026\"\n[1408] The Kurauchi doctor couple, Yoshida, Nagatani, and Mizuguchi went up to the roof together in the elevator. [1409] Ise Fujiko said she would go back to her room and walked towards the corridor. Only Yamanaka, Kuroda, and Aoi were left in the room. [1410] \"Come to my room, teachers,\" said Yamanaka as he walked towards the corridor. \"You must be tired. Or do you want to go back to the campsite?\" [1411] Edogawa said, \"It's unlikely that we can go back to the campsite. We are also witnesses to the incident\u2026 The police will ask us a lot of questions when they come.\" [1412] \"When will the police come?\" Mount Fuji forced a smile and asked, looking very tired, \"In the worst case, we may have to call the students here. Without a boat, you won't be able to go back. But your food reserves are only enough for three days, right?\" [1413]