3845] \"In hexadecimal, the number on the ones place goes up to 15\u2026\" Fujisawa said. \"But we only have the numbers 0 to 9 in the decimal system. In the decimal system, 10 is a two-digit number. 10 is represented by 1 and 0. In hexadecimal, 16 starts to become a two-digit number 10 (one zero). If we only use the numbers 0 to 9, hexadecimal cannot be used. So\u2026 in general, the numbers 10 to 15 are represented by the letters A, B, C, D, E, F. F is the 15 in the decimal system. Just like the 9 in the decimal system, F is the largest single digit in hexadecimal.\" [3846] \"So everything becomes 15...?\" M\u00e8nghu\u00ec seemed to be confused again. [3847] \"In the 1 to 10, 7 is alone...\" Xiyuan remembered Ms. Truehata's words and said, \"From 1 to 16... B and D become alone...\"\n[3848] \"B is 11, D is 13.\" M\u00e8nghu\u00ec answered, \"Ah, that's right... If it's within 16, 7 is no longer alone. Because there's 14... Dr. Truehata was talking about that... But what if everything becomes F?\" [3849] \"The maximum value of a single-precision integer type in the decimal system, 65535, is represented as FFFF in hexadecimal, which is the largest four-digit number. Counting from 0000, we can count up to all the digits becoming F... Counting until all the digits become F is the timer. This is the limit device. Dr. Truehata planned this at least seven years ago. From Dr. Truehata's room, there is no way to tamper with the system. But Dr. Truehata participated in the development of that system. The limit device is set to 65535 hours after the start, which is 65535 hours later. Dr. Truehata's sand timer started before 65535 hours that day.\" [3850] Xiyuan continued to look at everyone. \"The rest is the same as what Xiyuan said on the cloud. The anomaly in Red Magic was not caused by human intervention, but was set up in the program. That day, the yellow door couldn't be opened. Then, at the predetermined time, the door automatically opened. Because it was a performance, the lighting was dimmed and brightened. Everything was set up. However, for Deborah, who was developed after that, everything was an unforeseen error. Please check the source code of Red Magic carefully. The evidence is still there.\" [3851] 9\n[3852] \"Okay, let's move on to Dr. Momota's puzzle in the room...\" Fujisawa unconsciously walks around the room. This is a habit of his when teaching. \"However, Mr. Nishiyama has basically revealed the truth. In Dr. Momota's room, there was someone else besides Dr. Momota. And from the environmental conditions, we conclude that the person is Dr. Momota's child.\" [3853] \"Wait, wait...,\" Shibazaki raises his hand, \"But it was said that it's impossible...\"\n[3854] \"Wait, I don't accept it,\" Fujisawa says as he walks and looks down, \"When I accept a question, I always say this...\"\n[3855] Shibazaki looks at the department head, Nishiyama, with a bitter smile, but the department head's expression remains unchanged. [3856] \"There is a robot named MICHIRU in the inner bedroom...\u201d Nishida continued, \"It can unlock and lock. This has been confirmed. But why create this robot?\u201d\n[3857] \"It was a playmate for the child...\u201d Momiji immediately said. [3858] \"I acknowledge your statement...\u201d Nishida smiled, \"But that's secondary. I believe the initial motive was not this. It is likely that someone locked the bedroom door from the inside. Then they fell asleep. Therefore, Dr. Shinagawa could not sleep in bed all night. Imagine such a situation. For this, Dr. Shinagawa created the robot. Because it can unlock and lock...\u201d\n[3859] \"Boring, just take the lock off... why make a robot?\u201d Dr. Koyama smiled. [3860] \"That's the kind of thinking that only a genius can understand.\u201d Nishida shrugged, \"The child rebelled against his mother, locked the door, but fell asleep right away. Dr. Shinagawa did not remove the lock. She allowed the child to lock the door. However, after the child fell asleep, she let the robot unlock the door... I think it's a natural behavior...\"\n[3861] \"Regardless, after seeing that robot, I believe there is another person. And that person is a child\u2026 a girl who was locked inside fifteen years ago. No one has gone in since then. No, even if they did, they would come out immediately. Luggage has also undergone strict inspection. There are no channels\u2026 However, since the body was decomposed in the end, there must have been two people\u2026 How about it? From such environmental conditions, do you think there are any other possible answers? Can you come up with any other conclusions?\" [3862] \"Dr. Makoto was locked in that room when she was already pregnant with another child. Seven years later, a time-limited device called Red Magic was set up. Dr. Makoto calculated everything and decided to implement her plan.\" [3863] \"The same plan as what the Saotome said\u2026\" Shimizu looked at Momiji and said kindly, \"I always believed her plan was to have her daughter kill her. However, it wasn't like that\u2026\"\n[3864] \"Not?\" He just finished speaking, and Momiji immediately widened her eyes and put her hands over her mouth, retreating, \"Ah\u2026 what's going on\u2026\"\n[3865] \"Yes\u2026 it didn't go according to Dr. Makoto's imagination. Because\u2026\" He was at a loss for words, \"because\u2026 Dr. Makoto's child couldn't kill her mother. She couldn't follow her mother's orders. Because her child\u2026 is not a genius\u2026\"\n[3866] \"Not...?\" Moe's eyes reddened. [3867] \"It was not Dr. Makoto's daughter who killed her mother... It was Dr. Makoto who killed her daughter. Dr. Makoto's child was just an ordinary child. She was not a genius. She could not kill her own mother. She could not understand her mother's thoughts... As the deadline approached, this judgment was very cruel for Dr. Makoto. She must have been very troubled by this calculation error. That's why she left three pieces of information and also left