classified information,\" Ishida Fujiko put down her cup and sat next to Bunrei, \"I'll show it to you later. Miss Nishimura, show me your hand.\" [2054] \"Is it palm reading?\" Bunrei extended her left hand. [2055] \"No, I just want to see your hand\u2026\" Ishida Fujiko took Bunrei's hand, leaned her face with glasses closer, \"Your hand is so pretty\u2026 there's no trace of hardship. And you're a left-hander too\u2026 Hmm, what's this?\" [2056]\u3000\u3000\"I've learned archery. I'm in the archery club.\" Miyuki answers. [2057]\u3000\u3000\"Really? I was too. But that was in high school...\" Island Fujiko looks surprised and raises her head. [2058]\u3000\u3000\"Miss Island, what do you think about this? Do you have any ideas about it?\" Miyuki suddenly changes the topic. [2059]\u3000\u3000\"Oh, that. I received an email. It said you and Mr. Kamikura are investigating...\" Island Fujiko lets go of Miyuki's left hand, \"First of all, I want to say that the system's abnormality is the most suspicious. This simply shouldn't happen. Such an error...\"\n[2060]\u3000\u3000\"Was it caused by a virus?\" Miyuki asks. [2061] \"Neither a virus nor anything else could cause such a flaw.\" It\u014d leaned her glasses-clad face closer to Bunmei, \"I find the system's abnormality more terrifying than this murder case\u2026\"\n[2062] \"Do you not find this incident unbelievable?\" Bunmei leaned back slightly. She wanted to take a sip of coffee, but the temperature was still too hot for her sensitive palate. [2063] \"Well, I was surprised by Ms. Makoto's attire,\" It\u014d answered, \"I fainted, so my memory isn't very clear\u2026 It seemed like she was wearing a wedding dress, I think\u2026\"\n[2064] \"Ms. It\u014d, are you still single?\" Bunmei asked tentatively, as she had heard from Nagi that all the staff members at the institute, except for New Vine Director and Doctor Kurahashi, were single. [2065] \"Yes, I'm not married yet.\" It\u014d answered with a smile, \"I'm not interested in men at all.\" [2066] \"Wow?\" Momiji shivered, \"What then?\" [2067] \"I only watch anime.\" Itou continued, \"These days, you can find a lover through a computer. I still find anime characters more convenient\u2026 Is Sugawara-sensei your boyfriend? You're not his secretary, are you?\" [2068] \"I'm a student.\" Momiji answered. [2069] \"Sugawara-sensei is quite nice, isn't he? Is he single?\" Itou narrowed her eyes and smiled. [2070] \"Itou-san, don't you think that's contradictory to what you just said? It's too\u2026\" Momiji chuckled bitterly. [2071] \"No, I don't think so\u2026\" Miyata Fujiko leaned back in her chair and yawned, \"Well, I don't mean that Mr. Sugawara doesn't seem like a real person, but I just feel like his heart has stopped beating. But that's what makes him attractive, right? Do you understand?\" [2072] \"No, I don't understand,\" replied Minghui immediately. In fact, she not only completely disagreed with Miyata Fujiko's opinion, but she also felt angry after hearing Miyata Fujiko's words. [2073] \"Ah, never mind. Maybe I'm a little strange\u2026\"\n[2074] 4\n[2075] \"I really don't know anything about that incident (referring to the incident fifteen years ago when Dr. Makoto Shibata killed his parents).\" [2076] \"You weren't here at the time, were you?\" Sone asked. [2077] \"No, I think she went out twice\u2026 Well, it was a year and a half after the incident. The trial took a long time, but I didn't see it.\" [2078] \"You've never been in her room before, have you?\" Sone asked, playing with the kirin model on the table. There were many other small animals around it. [2079] \"No, it was the first time yesterday.\" [2080] \"Really, no one has ever been in her room?\" [2081] \"As far as I know, no... but the chief might have...\"\n[2082] \"Is she afraid of interacting with others?\" [2083] \"Yes, Ms. Akagi always refuses to see people.\" [2084] \"What did you think when you first saw Dr. Akagi's room?\" Saito wanted to hear Mizuno's opinion. [2085] \"It was amazing! It was so clean. Who did the cleaning?\" [2086] \"Who do you think did it?\" [2087] \"You really are inquisitive.\" Water shrugged his shoulders in response. \"Think about it, even the data was deleted. I'm really upset about the loss of Dr. Shigeta's data. It's a big loss for us.\" [2088] \"Were there any valuable data?\" [2089] \"No, not really.\" Water answered promptly. He glanced at Detective Kamikura and quickly looked away. \"There were some data worth millions or more, but it's not worth trading human lives for. We should focus more on how the killer killed Dr. Shigeta and how he did it.\" [2090] \"Do you have any suggestions about this?\" Detective Kamikura asked. [2091] \"None at all,\" Shigemori answered quickly. \"There's no way there could be a secret passage. I checked when the building was being constructed. I'm certain there's no secret passage... it's impossible for an ordinary person to do it.\" [2092] \"It's impossible for an ordinary person to do it,\" Nishikawa repeated Shigemori's words. \"Why do you think that?\" [2093] \"I didn't mean anything by it,\" Shigemori answered vaguely. [2094] \"When did 'Red Magic' start being used in its current version?\" Nishikawa asked, changing the subject. [2095] Shigemori thought for a moment before answering, \"It's been about seven or eight years... we were using the third version before that.\" [2096] \"Was it designed by Dr. Makoto Yoshikawa?\" Shigemori asked. [2097] \"Yes, that's right... The third version was completely designed by Dr. Makoto Yoshikawa. We started participating in the development of the fourth version. We made a lot of improvements based on Dr. Yoshikawa's design. Dr. Yoshikawa also designed the compiler. In any case, the security of 'Red Magic' is flawless. It can handle all manual labor. We already thought of this danger when we designed this system. It can counteract all software sabotage. That's why we're so surprised by this anomaly. It's a difficult problem. It's just not possible.\" [2098] \"Have you added any new programs?\" [2099] \"Many... We're still investigating. It could be a Trojan horse program, at least that's what I think. We're investigating this possibility. But we still find it hard to believe...\"\n[2100] Shigemori's office had more items than the vice-chief's office. There were many small animal models in his room, and it was like a tropical savannah. A steel shelf against the wall was neatly lined with small car models. It was clean and tidy. Shigemori didn't mention his hobbies. [2101] \"Who could have hated the director?\" Shimizu felt that the question he asked was too ordinary, and he regretted it. [2102] \"How would I know...?\" Water Valley replied. \"Anyway, we are all very troubled now. Dr. Makoto's death is a big blow to us, and the director's death is the same. Although we don't know who the murderer is, we feel the crisis that our research institute is facing. None of the staff at our institute expressed dissatisfaction or complained. Being able to work in such a place is already very satisfying for us... We would never deliberately destroy this environment.\" [2103] \"What about outsiders?\" [2104] \"No, that's even more impossible.\" Water Valley suddenly lowered his voice and slowly answered. He may have noticed that his previous and current statements were contradictory. \"Indeed... It's really hard to understand. Why would they do such a thing? What's their purpose?\" [2105]5\n[2106] The streets were very beautiful under the neon lights. [2107] Mai drew was sitting on a model car. The car had a simple frame and a loud engine sound. She felt the slow acceleration from the seat behind her. The road was black and looked a little wet. Mai looked up and saw that the weather was sunny, with cotton-like clouds floating in the sky. There were several cars flying in the sky, just like the one Mai was driving. She looked closely and saw that there were three of them. Mai swayed the steering wheel left and right, and the car slowly moved as the body shook. Mai was in a good mood. [2108] \"How can I fly...?\" [2109] Mai looked up at the sky while thinking. [2110] She looked down at the instrument panel in front of her. There was a speedometer and several buttons, but Mai didn't know which switch to press to make the car fly into the air. Occasionally there would be a few signs on the road, but Mai couldn't understand what was written on them. There were no pedestrians on the street. [2111] As she approached the intersection, Momo slowed down and turned left. [2112] A blue small car was speeding down the opposite road. After passing by, Momo looked back and saw that the car came to a sudden stop and made a U-turn behind her. [2113] Perhaps Momo's car was too slow. Soon, the blue car behind her caught up. It drove alongside Momo on the right. The face of the man driving looked very realistic, but Momo felt that the face was too flat and unreliable.\n <Assistant> I have read the book and I will answer the question you ask.\n\nPassage 8:\nDialogue between User and Assistant 2026-06-12 03:47:35 \\n<User> The following context is the book I have read: \nMiyuki usually drove a bright red 4000CC sports car, but Xuzhou had also seen this Jaguar sedan in the underground parking lot of the West Garden's house. [333] The luxury car quietly stopped in front of everyone, and the back door opened. A white-haired elderly man with white gloves was sitting in the driver's seat. [334] West Garden Miyuki wore large pink sunglasses, white sailor pants, and a striped white and beige T-shirt. After getting out of the car, she quickly opened a white umbrella. She looked quite elegant, but it was out of place. So someone in the group sighed softly. [335] \"Help me out,\" she stood behind the car and quickly opened the trunk, \"The luggage is too heavy for me to carry. Who can help me?\" [336] \"What's in there?\" The oldest student, Kuroda, said, \"Mouri-san, bringing things you can't carry yourself will only cause trouble for others.\" [337] \"But they're everyone's things,\" Mouri smiled. \"Everyone would like some cool things, wouldn't they?\" [338] Two large refrigerators were in the trunk. [339] \"Ah, beer? You're so thoughtful,\" said Mouri's friend, Higashimura. [340] \"One of them is beer,\" Mouri said to Kuroda and Higashimura, who were lifting the refrigerators out of the trunk. \"The other one is ice cream.\" [341] \"Ice cream?\" Kunieda exclaimed. The students murmured in admiration again. [342] Sukigawa turned to the driver's compartment and spoke to the elderly man inside, Takakura. Takakura got out of the car and bowed deeply to Sukigawa. He had worked for the West Garden family for over 30 years and was their butler. Despite the summer heat, he wore a black suit and tie. [343] \"Please take good care of her, teacher,\" Takakura said softly, his voice still cool and elegant even in the heat of the barren landscape. [344] \"Of course, don't worry,\" Sukigawa replied softly. For some reason, he didn't want the students to hear him, \"Has she ever gone camping before?\" [345] \"No, it's her first time,\" Takakura said with a smile. \"She seems very excited...\"\n[346] \"Ah, I can see that she is very excited\u2026\" Y\u016btani winked at Takeyama. [347] 2\n[348] The returning boat skillfully docked at the pier. It was a small boat about five meters long, with a canopy over the cockpit and a tent at the back. Y\u016btani had only seen boats like this with open decks in Hanoi and Istanbul. [349] \"Excuse me, are you Mr. Y\u016btani?\" A man approached Y\u016btani with a warm smile. [350] \"Yes, I am.\" [351] \"I am from the Shigemura Research Institute, my name is Yamane.\" The man nodded slightly. \"Is that Miss Nishiyama?\" [352] \"No, it's not me.\" The exchange student, Xiao Wu, answered quickly. [353] \"Miss Nishiyama is over there...\" Sugawara pointed to the girl with an umbrella buying juice from the vending machine. \"I'm sorry for the trouble. It's really nice of you to come all the way here.\" [354] \"No problem.\" Yamane shook his head. \"The director asked me to guide you, so I came. It's the first time we've had so many guests on the island. If you don't mind, how about a small welcome party tomorrow night...?\" [355] \"Is the campsite close to the research institute?\" Sugawara asked as he walked. The students had already boarded the boat. [356] \"The island is small, and the research institute and the campsite are at the two ends of the island. Well... it takes about ten minutes to walk there, of course we also have cars...\"\n[357] Yamane seems to be a little older than Xucun. He doesn't look like an office worker, wearing a T-shirt and jeans, with messy hair and a beard that hasn't been shaved for a few days. After getting on the boat, Yamane handed Xucun a business card. His name is Yamane Yashin, and his position is Vice President of the Shinagawa Research Institute. Xucun was a little surprised. [358] \"How many employees does the Shinagawa Research Institute have?\" Xucun didn't bring his own business card. [359] \"About fifty people fixed.\" Yamane sat on the bench of the small boat. [360] West Garden is the last to board the boat. She folded her umbrella and came to Xucun's side. [361] \"Miharu, this is Shigemura-san, the Deputy Director of the research institute.\" Kusaka introduced Miharu to Shigemura. [362] \"Hello.\" Miharu quickly bowed. [363] \"You visited a month ago,\" Shigemura said with a smile to Miharu. \"I was out of town and didn't see you. I heard you are the old friend of the director\u2026\"\n[364] \"So, you mean the fourth power of an old friend,\" Miharu smiled, tilting her head slightly. \"He asked me to visit Dr. Nishikawa Harumi.\" [365] \"Ah, that's rare,\" Shigemura said. \"I also watched the video of your conversation with Dr. Nishikawa, and it was a very meaningful conversation.\" [366] \"W\u01d2 h\u00e1i r\u00e1n w\u00e9i sh