ose 'People'.\" [3481] Shimizu looked at the menu bar on the screen in front of him. The rangefinder appeared in his line of sight, and the menu opened one by one. Seeing the 'Air Conference' button, he pressed it with his right hand. Then, Shimizu selected people he knew from the list of names. [3482] \"Who is Shimizu-san?\" Shimizu asked Tomiko. \"The last one, the tourist...\"\n[3483] He also selected the last \"tourist.\" [3484] \"Let's also choose Miss Yasuoka,\" Tomiko said, \"She might be nobita...\"\n[3485] The last name on the list was \"nobita,\" so she was also selected. [3486] \"It really is Yoshida-san...\" Shiroi smiled. \"Is that the default?\" (Translator's note: The Japanese words for \"Yoshida-san\" and \"nobita\" sound similar.) [3487] \"Yes, it's the machine in the conversation room,\" answered Itoh. \"Yuki-san doesn't have a headshot data either, so the machine generated a replacement.\" [3488] Checking the list, there was no \"MICHIRU\"... Shiroi looked around. The floating screen confirmed the button alternately. Shiroi pressed it with his right hand. [3489] 2\n[3490] Shiroi's Kato suddenly accelerated, finally leaving the ground. The acceleration made him feel dizzy. It was not a pleasant feeling. [3491] However, when he flew above the clouds, his mood improved a bit. [3492] \"It's really cool to have a meeting in the sky\u2026,\" he thought. It felt like the gods of Greek mythology. [3493] Sugawara's car finally stopped, hovering silently above the white clouds. The clouds below flowed slowly. The ground was nowhere to be seen. It was probably using the clouds to save computational resources. [3494] One by one, the attendees floated up from the clouds and formed a circle. They kept a distance that was just enough for the cars to touch, and their faces were clearly visible. [3495]\n[3496] The members present were the same as those selected by Kaneko. [3497] The only ones who did not look like themselves were Yoshitsune Higashikawa, who resemb