ome up with. It's a common line used by detectives in mystery novels. Let's discuss this calmly.\" [2378] \"I've been calm all along,\" Honjou said, even more angry. [2379] \"By the way\u2026\" Saito said expressionlessly. \"There are many people who could have killed the chief on the roof. Several of the people we know have suspicions, such as the chief's wife and Miss Akutagawa. They were together the whole time, so they could have plotted the murder together.\" [2380] \"I visited the chief's wife's room at that time, and I don't think it was like that,\" said Takayama's wife, who was sitting next to her. \"They were both there when I went to the chief's wife's room.\" [2381] \"No. You went up to the director's wife's room after the director's helicopter arrived. Before you went there, they could have killed the director... and Mr. Bowen went to the first floor, and Mrs. New Vine went to Mr. New Vine's office alone, didn't she?\" [2382] \"Yes, I was taking care of Miss Akiko...\" Mrs. Bowen hurriedly said. [2383] \"Then we can assume that Mrs. New Vine went to the roof alone and killed Mr. New Vine.\" Xucun finished, straightening his legs again, \"As Mr. Bowen said, we are only speculating on this possibility. I haven't read any mystery novels, so I can't analyze it as thoroughly as the book's detective...\"\n[2384] Bongru leaned back on the sofa and looked up at the skylight, \"But why isn't there any data in the record file of the Debora Management System that shows that someone opened the door to the roof...?\" [2385] \"Yes, that's the problem.\" Xucun agreed with Bongru's statement, \"But let's put the data issue aside for now, which is a software issue.\" [2386] \"If that's the case, anyone could have entered or exited through the other exit on the roof,\" Dr. Komuro said, \"It's unrealistic to suspect the director's wife. She would never conspire with Future-san to commit murder.\" [2387] \"Yeah,\" Shimizu shrugged. [2388] \"It also doesn't match the elevator display I saw,\" Kuroneko muttered to herself. [2389] \"Indeed,\" Shimizu confirmed Kuroneko's statement again. [2390] \"I still find it hard to believe,\" Kuroneko said to Shimizu beside her. [2391] \"Impossible.\" Xushu nodded with a smile, \"It's too strange.\" [2392] \"Teacher...\" Meng Hui's cheeks puffed up in anger. [2393] \"Should we not listen to some strange opinions?\" Xushu made a cross with his two index fingers. [2394] 2\n[2395] Xushu and Meng Hui wandered around the research institute. They didn't meet anyone, but they met several times with P1 robots. Xushu recalled the layout of the research institute as he walked forward, and Meng Hui's sixth sense was always accurate. The two of them took the elevator to the roof. [2396] To get to the roof of this building, only the elevator can be used. Staircases are not possible. In general buildings, this is not conducive to preventing disasters. However, the fire and disaster prevention measures of this research institute are different from other places. The number of fire sprinklers installed in each room is three times the ordinary standard, and the doors have automatic fire protection functions. The design of the forced ventilation system is also unique. In case of emergency, the staff of the institute is the safest by staying in their own rooms. The building is not designed with the premise of escaping from all directions. As for the measures to deal with earthquakes, it is even more remarkable. There are no windows and no large rooms inside. All the walls of the rooms use anti-seismic materials. The safety of the building structure of this research institute is extremely high, almost comparable to nuclear power plants. [2397] The sky was clear. The eastern sky was dotted with stars before dawn. Venus is not a special planet. Compared with the Earth, Mercury and Venus run on orbits closer to the sun, so we can always see them near the sun. This is also the reason why they only appear in the morning. [2